# Top-level node_modules entry only matches /node_modules — use **/ to catch
# nested ones like apps/web/node_modules so host-side workspace links don't
# leak into the build context and override Bun's container-side linking.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env
.env.local
.git
.agents
.kiro
.windsurf
.vs
.claude
